<title>USA: ESS Technology names John Barnet as CFO.</title>
<headline>ESS Technology names John Barnet as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ESS Technology Inc said Monday it appointed John Barnet as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Barnet succeeds Ralph Harms, who left the company to pursue other business interests, ESS said. Barnet is a former chief financial officer of Trimble Navigation Co Ltd.</p>
<p>ESS designs, develops and markets highly integrated mixed-signal semiconductors and software for multimedia applications.</p>
<p>Shares of ESS were 1/4 higher at 15 in Monday afternoon trading on the Nasdaq.</p>
